## 3. Naming & cấu trúc

### File
| Loại | Quy ước | Ví dụ |
|---|---|---|
| JS module | camelCase | `form-scanner.js`, `context-menu.js` |
| CSS | kebab-case | `admin.css`, `studio.css` |
| Hàm JS | camelCase | `renderLeads()`, `loadAnalytics()` |
| ID HTML | camelCase | `leadTable`, `btnRefresh` |
| Data attribute | kebab-case | `data-config`, `data-ve-id` |

### Đặc tả DOM
```html
<!-- Alpine.js (x-data, x-show, x-model) -->
<template x-data="{ open: false }">
    <button @click="open = !open">Toggle</button>
    <div x-show="open">Nội dung</div>
</template>
```

### Gọi API
```javascript
// ✅ Đúng — dùng API_BASE_URL từ config.js
const API_BASE = window.APEX_ADMIN_CONFIG?.API_BASE_URL || '';
const res = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/leads?page=1&limit=50`, {
    headers: { 'Authorization': `Bearer ${getToken()}` }
});
const data = await res.json();

// ❌ Sai — hardcode domain
const res = await fetch('https://crm.hanghoaphaisinh.net/api/leads');
```

